 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [1.5.0] - 2026-10-07
+
+### Added
+
+- `parse` accepts days (`2d4h`), where a day is exactly 24 hours.
+- `format` takes an optional `{ days: true }` to show days (`1d 2h`). The default
+  output is unchanged.
+
 ## [1.4.0] - 2026-06-02
 
 ### Added
